OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood stars in North East for
OL,4,Afarming thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor who starred in the Jurassic
OL,7,FWorld franchise has said "it's been
OL,8,Fcool to get out of London" as she films
OL,9,Fa feature length film set entirely in
OL,10,Fnorth-east England.
OL,12,FNewcastle production company House 54
OL,13,Fhas been shooting MacDonald on
OL,14,Flocations in County Durham and
OL,15,FNorthumberland.
OL,17,FDirected, produced and written by
OL,18,FDaniel Patrick Vaughan, the rural
OL,19,Fthriller focuses on a family of farmers
OL,20,Funder vast economic pressure who will
OL,21,Fdo anything to survive.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
