OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood stars in North East for
OL,4,Afarming thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsabella Sermon, who plays the role of
OL,7,FMarlene, said: "I'm loving it, we've
OL,8,Fbeen filming on lots of farms and one
OL,9,Fnight we watched the sun set over the
OL,10,Ffields - it was stunning, it's really
OL,11,Fbeautiful up here."
